wildos-ui (0.1.12) trixie; urgency=medium

  * NoPaste: a field with it takes only what is typed. Paste, Shift+Insert,
    middle click and dropped text do nothing, and its right-click menu has
    no Paste.
  * Double-clicking the top or bottom edge of a Wild OS app's window
    stretches it to the screen's full height, a side to its full width,
    as on Windows. Double-click again to put it back.

 -- Wild OS Developers <dev@wildos.io>  Sat, 14 Nov 2026 09:45:00 +0000

wildos-ui (0.1.11) trixie; urgency=medium

  * The right-click menu for text no longer ends what you were typing
    in boxes that finish when you click away, such as renaming a file.
    Closing the menu with Escape puts you back in the box instead of
    nowhere, and clicking elsewhere finishes the box as before. An app
    with its own undo, like Notes, can send Undo through the menu.

 -- Wild OS Developers <dev@wildos.io>  Sat, 14 Nov 2026 08:54:22 +0000

